<title>USA: Cryomedical responds to incident.</title>
<headline>Cryomedical responds to incident.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cryomedical Sciences Inc said that due to a recent clinical incident involving a competitor's high-pressure gas cryosurgical device, which resulted in harm to the patient, it is making available half day safety refresher courses.</p>
<p>The refresher courses will be given at no cost to all users of cryosurgical instrumentation throughout the U.S.</p>
<p>Cryosurgery involves minimally invasive surgical procedures.</p>
</text>
